OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry over the weekend although the odd
OL,7,Fshower still possible in the west.
OL,8,FRain likely to spread northeast on
OL,9,FMonday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
